Package: org.Osativa.eg.db
Title: Genome-wide annotation for Oryza sativa (MSU and RAP-DB)
Description: Organism annotation package for Oryza sativa Japonica Group.
    The central gene ID (GID) is the MSU/RGAP LOC_Os identifier. RAP-DB
    locus IDs are available as keytype RAP for bidirectional ID conversion
    and enrichment. Gene Ontology terms come from the RAP-DB 2026-02-05
    representative annotation mapped onto MSU IDs. Because RAP-DB does not
    publish evidence codes in that file, EVIDENCE is recorded as IEA.
Version: 0.3.0
